        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="欢迎来到我的数字花园-🌱"><a href="#欢迎来到我的数字花园-🌱" class="headerlink" title="欢迎来到我的数字花园 🌱"></a>欢迎来到我的数字花园 🌱</h1><blockquote><p>在这里，代码与文字相遇，技术与思考交织</p></blockquote><h2 id="🔍-文章搜索"><a href="#🔍-文章搜索" class="headerlink" title="🔍 文章搜索"></a>🔍 文章搜索</h2><div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; margin: 20px 0;">  <input type="text" placeholder="🔍 搜索文章、标签或关键词..." style="width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border: 2px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; outline: none; transition: all 0.3s ease;">  <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: #6c757d;">    试试搜索：Vue3源码 | 微前端 | 性能优化 | 架构设计  </div></div><h2 id="📚-精选文章"><a href="#📚-精选文章" class="headerlink" title="📚 精选文章"></a>📚 精选文章</h2><h3 id="🎯-技术深度"><a href="#🎯-技术深度" class="headerlink" title="🎯 技术深度"></a>🎯 技术深度</h3><div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">  <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">    <a href="/posts/vue3-reactivity" style="text-decoration: none; color: #2c3e50;">      🔥 Vue3 响应式系统源码完全解析    </a>  </h3>  <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">    📅 2024-01-15 | ⏱ 阅读 15min | 👁️ 2.3k 浏览  </div>  <p style="color: #495057; line-height: 1.6;">    深入剖析Vue3响应式原理，从ref到effect，完整理解现代前端框架的响应式实现。包含Proxy源码分析、依赖收集机制、computed原理详解...  </p>  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">    <span style="background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976d2; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">Vue3</span>    <span style="background: #f3e5f5; color: #7b1fa2; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">源码</span>    <span style="background: #e8f5e8; color: #388e3c; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px;">前端</span>  </div></div><div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">  <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">    <a href="/posts/micro-frontend" style="text-decoration: none; color: #2c3e50;">      🏗️ 微前端架构实战：从qiankun到模块联邦    </a>  </h3>  <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">    📅 2024-01-08 | ⏱ 阅读 20min | 👁️ 1.8k 浏览  </div>  <p style="color: #495057; line-height: 1.6;">    大型前端应用架构演进，微前端落地实践与坑点总结。包含qiankun源码解析、模块联邦最佳实践、沙箱机制详解...  </p>  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">    <span style="background: #fff3e0; color: #f57c00; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">微前端</span>    <span style="background: #e0f2f1; color: #00796b; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">架构</span>    <span style="background: #fce4ec; color: #c2185b; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px;">qiankun</span>  </div></div><h3 id="⚡-工程实践"><a href="#⚡-工程实践" class="headerlink" title="⚡ 工程实践"></a>⚡ 工程实践</h3><div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 15px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">  <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">    <a href="/posts/webpack-optimization" style="text-decoration: none; color: #2c3e50;">      🚀 Webpack 5 极致性能优化指南    </a>  </h3>  <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">    📅 2023-12-20 | ⏱ 阅读 12min | 👁️ 3.1k 浏览  </div>  <p style="color: #495057; line-height: 1.6;">    从构建速度到打包体积，全面解析Webpack 5优化策略。包含缓存策略、代码分割、Tree Shaking深度优化...  </p>  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">    <span style="background: #e8f5e8; color: #388e3c; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">Webpack</span>    <span style="background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976d2; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; margin-right: 8px;">性能优化</span>    <span style="background: #fff3e0; color: #f57c00; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px;">工程化</span>  </div></div><h2 id="📊-文章分类"><a href="#📊-文章分类" class="headerlink" title="📊 文章分类"></a>📊 文章分类</h2><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 30px 0;">    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px;">    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">🎨 前端艺术</h3>    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 框架原理与源码解析</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 工程化与性能优化</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 可视化与图形编程</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 跨端技术演进</li>    </ul>  </div>  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f093fb 0%, #f5576c 100%); color: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px;">    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">⚙️ 后端匠心</h3>    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 分布式系统设计</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 高并发架构实践</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 数据库性能调优</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 云原生技术栈</li>    </ul>  </div>  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4facfe 0%, #00f2fe 100%); color: white; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px;">    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0;">🚀 全栈视野</h3>    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;">      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 微服务治理</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• DevOps文化实践</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 技术团队管理</li>      <li style="margin: 8px 0;">• 产品思维培养</li>    </ul>  </div></div><h2 id="🏷️-热门标签"><a href="#🏷️-热门标签" class="headerlink" title="🏷️ 热门标签"></a>🏷️ 热门标签</h2><div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;">    <span style="background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976d2; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">Vue3 (12)</span>    <span style="background: #fff3e0; color: #f57c00; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">React (8)</span>    <span style="background: #e8f5e8; color: #388e3c; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">TypeScript (15)</span>    <span style="background: #fce4ec; color: #c2185b; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">Node.js (9)</span>    <span style="background: #e0f2f1; color: #00796b; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">架构设计 (7)</span>    <span style="background: #f3e5f5; color: #7b1fa2; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">性能优化 (11)</span>    <span style="background: #e8eaf6; color: #303f9f; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">微前端 (6)</span>    <span style="background: #fff8e1; color: #ff8f00; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer;">云原生 (5)</span>  </div></div><h2 id="📈-月度归档"><a href="#📈-月度归档" class="headerlink" title="📈 月度归档"></a>📈 月度归档</h2><div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; margin: 20px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px;">    <div>      <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">2024年</h4>      <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">1月 (2篇)</div>    </div>    <div>      <h4 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">2023年</h4>      <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">12月 (3篇)</div>      <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">11月 (2篇)</div>      <div style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 14px;">10月 (4篇)</div>    </div>  </div></div><hr><h2 id="关于我-✨"><a href="#关于我-✨" class="headerlink" title="关于我 ✨"></a>关于我 ✨</h2><p>一名热爱技术的全栈开发者，在数字世界的探索中不断成长。相信技术应该服务于创造美好，代码不仅是工具，更是表达思想的方式。</p><p><strong>技术栈深度：</strong></p><ul><li>🎨 <strong>前端艺术</strong>：Vue3、React、TypeScript、微前端</li><li>⚙️ <strong>后端匠心</strong>：Node.js、NestJS、云原生架构  </li><li>🗄️ <strong>数据之美</strong>：PostgreSQL、Redis、Elasticsearch</li><li>🚀 <strong>工程之道</strong>：Docker、Kubernetes、DevOps</li></ul><h2 id="与我连接-🌐"><a href="#与我连接-🌐" class="headerlink" title="与我连接 🌐"></a>与我连接 🌐</h2><div style="display: flex; gap: 15px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 20px 0;">  <a href="mailto:hello@example.com" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: #ea4335; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">    ✉️ 邮箱  </a>  <a href="https://github.com/username" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: #333; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">    🐙 GitHub  </a>  <a href="https://juejin.cn/user/username" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; background: #1e80ff; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">    💼 掘金  </a></div><blockquote><p><strong>思考让技术更有温度，创造让代码产生价值</strong><br>© 2024 墨宸的数字花园 · 用心编织每一行代码</p></blockquote>]]></content>
      
      
      
